"purple","content":"<p><strong>GENERATOR \u00b7 check_generator<\/strong><\/p><p>Restore power after accepting the task and collecting enough cells. Then reach the exit.<\/p>","width":441},"567ce162-983d-43ba-b0d6-409dce845e18":{"y":9860,"x":9620,"autoHeight":true,"height":148,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>PICKUP \u00b7 collect_cell<\/strong><\/p><p>Check duplicates, then task acceptance. Unreal collects the cell before the next element displays the updated count.<\/p>","width":501},"617a47ca-5627-4dd4-a761-e4e9436af53c":{"y":8850,"x":8500,"autoHeight":true,"height":320,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>OBJECTIVES AND UI<\/strong><\/p><p>Reset quest_ui defaults, then override only the fields that change. The final element supplies the objective.<\/p><p>Keep one Arcscript statement per code block. Shared HUD and world text live in UI components.<\/p>","width":4900},"8a1702ae-b5fe-44cb-bacd-97868065a17c":{"y":12180,"x":9820,"autoHeight":false,"height":106,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>EXIT \u00b7 enter_exit<\/strong><\/p><p>Entering the powered exit completes the task. Repeat entry only shows feedback.<\/p>","width":361}},"elements":{"10be7825-974e-4306-b8e4-d2bbc63486dd":{"x":10620,"y":11740,"theme":"orange","width":360,"height":170,"outputs":[],"autoHeight":true,"components":[],"content":"<pre><code>show(\"The generator needs \", quest.required_power_cells, \" power cells. You have \", player.power_cells, \". Collect the missing cells, then try again.\")<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>Generator \u00b7 missing cells<\/p>"},"825244f4-6345-4314-b731-1f378ae010a1":{"width":430,"y":10700,"x":10600,"height":180,"theme":"orange","autoHeight":true,"attributes":[],"content":"<pre><code>show(\"Collect power cells (\", player.power_cells, \"\/\", quest.required_power_cells, \"), then use the generator.\")<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>Display \u00b7 collecting<\/p>"},"bfc100c0-7b99-4404-a71c-c1b42b102c02":{"x":10620,"y":11380,"theme":"green","width":360,"height":170,"outputs":[],"autoHeight":true,"components":["80c7c42c-bb19-4065-8afa-7cd5b54776fc"],"content":"<pre><code>quest.power_restored = true<\/code><\/pre><p><strong>Power restored.<\/strong> The lights come on and the exit gate opens. Reach the illuminated exit to complete your escape.<\/p>","title":"<p>Generator \u00b7 restore power<\/p>"},"e60800d3-a5aa-49c4-9b9c-fb5f8c1c09e7":{"x":10600,"y":9260,"theme":"cyan","width":360,"height":170,"outputs":[],"autoHeight":true,"components":[],"content":"<pre><code>quest.started = true<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>show(\"The outpost is dark. Collect \", quest.required_power_cells, \" power cells, then use the generator to restore the lights and open the exit gate.\")<\/code><\/pre><p>You can try the generator before collecting all required cells.<\/p>","title":"<p>Terminal \u00b7 accept task<\/p>"},"05d919db-a991-45b7-b20f-db02dbd6f307":{"width":360,"y":11080,"x":10620,"height":170,"theme":"purple","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>Use the terminal to accept the task first.<\/p><p>The generator is waiting for authorization. Return here after accepting the restore-power task.<\/p>","title":"<p>Generator \u00b7 terminal required<\/p>"},"76724a0b-9935-4c27-9941-90c63f3a795c":{"width":420,"y":10620,"x":7100,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["5c4525c2-d6b1-4335-9b21-e3e5efeed2c9"],"content":"<p>Handling world event\u2026<\/p>","title":"<p>Handle world event<\/p>"},"09438fc8-be1d-4f8a-adad-30170999ca60":{"width":430,"y":10140,"x":12020,"height":180,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"attributes":[],"content":"<p>Power restored. Walk through the open gate.<\/p>","title":"<p>Display \u00b7 powered<\/p>"},"a21dc333-37fa-4de2-9213-0acfbfff4811":{"width":501,"y":9880,"x":10580,"height":290,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["8097bcd1-3a2c-4151-a7fe-149f63f71533"],"content":"<p>Updating powered station display.<\/p><pre><code>quest_ui.grid_status = \"GRID ONLINE\"<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>quest_ui.generator_prompt = \"Review running generator\"<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>quest_ui.generator_label = \"GENERATOR \/ ONLINE\"<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>quest_ui.gate_label = \"GATE 01 \/ ACCESS GRANTED\"<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>Display setup \u00b7 power online<\/p>"},"35f2414d-8156-474e-98d3-eaf74211d45b":{"width":370,"y":9880,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"orange","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>This power cell has already been collected.<\/p>","title":"<p>Pickup denied \u00b7 already collected<\/p>"},"172fb20d-be4b-40f7-acec-fb22e76afe50":{"width":430,"y":10340,"x":10600,"height":180,"theme":"purple","autoHeight":true,"attributes":[],"content":"<pre><code>quest_ui.terminal_prompt = \"Read station terminal\"<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>quest_ui.cell_prompt = \"Read the station terminal first\"<\/code><\/pre><p>Use the terminal to begin.<\/p>","title":"<p>Display \u00b7 unaccepted<\/p>"},"7be79d97-39d8-4179-ad71-4b60b4ee62c8":{"width":430,"y":10280,"x":9000,"height":434,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["634f7d62-b92c-4017-8611-2f775a54ff05"],"attributes":["e0147f3d-6b80-4752-bb0d-6183862aa38e"],"content":"<p>Refreshing objective display.<\/p><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.mission_heading)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.grid_status)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.terminal_prompt)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.cell_prompt)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.generator_prompt)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.generator_label)<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>reset(quest_ui.gate_label)<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>Refresh \u00b7 objective and prompts<\/p>"},"b87fd479-2ae1-4201-aaae-a738b8b53f99":{"width":430,"y":11000,"x":10600,"height":180,"theme":"gold","autoHeight":true,"attributes":[],"content":"<pre><code>quest_ui.generator_prompt = \"Install cells and restore power\"<\/code><\/pre><p>Return to the generator and restore power.<\/p>","title":"<p>Display \u00b7 ready<\/p>"},"6af8cc14-6034-4e97-ab3f-6ebbdc207161":{"width":370,"y":10480,"x":11300,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<pre><code>show(\"Collected a power cell (\", player.power_cells, \"\/\", quest.required_power_cells, \").\")<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>Pickup accepted \u00b7 updated inventory<\/p>"},"f2d75b83-f348-4b58-8190-b68d119db86d":{"width":370,"y":12540,"x":10720,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<pre><code>quest.completed = true<\/code><\/pre><p>You reached the exit. Task complete.<\/p>","title":"<p>Exit reached \u00b7 task complete<\/p>"},"2689f5bc-f257-4b93-8d03-16760617ef62":{"width":370,"y":9040,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The terminal's task has already been accepted. Continue restoring power to the station.<\/p>","title":"<p>Terminal \u00b7 task already accepted<\/p>"},"41df4d86-d079-4785-a22a-013597633640":{"width":370,"y":8840,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>Power is restored and the gate is open. Walk through the exit to complete the task.<\/p>","title":"<p>Terminal \u00b7 exit is ready<\/p>"},"c80115f9-8323-42c8-b514-6d7895ad6852":{"width":370,"y":8660,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The terminal confirms the task is complete.<\/p>","title":"<p>Terminal \u00b7 task already complete<\/p>"},"f0fd0f64-ef53-446f-a43b-63746394bba0":{"width":370,"y":10780,"x":10620,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The generator is already running and the gate is open.<\/p>","title":"<p>Generator \u00b7 already online<\/p>"},"469d524b-9a3e-41b4-9f94-67a17246b608":{"width":370,"y":10180,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"purple","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>Use the terminal to accept the task first.<\/p>","title":"<p>Pickup denied \u00b7 accept the task<\/p>"},"988b8226-23eb-4990-b481-19cd7cd3145c":{"width":370,"y":10480,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"gold","autoHeight":true,"components":["06f4de3e-a022-472e-a2f9-bd73ee5875ee"],"outputs":["cf1cba2c-37e7-44